{"time": 1774182136, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1744186576", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1916949569]开门的是一个看起来有点憔悴的母亲，“你有啥事啊”"}
{"time": 1774182179, "type": "recv", "message_id": "502264826", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“不确定，但我这种走道上的，直觉不会错。小心点”"}
