{"time": 1774184992, "type": "recv", "message_id": "61171124", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“荷仙姑？是八仙过海里面那个何仙姑吗？”"}
{"time": 1774185036, "type": "recv", "message_id": "12087775", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "应该刻了有一定时间了，至少应该不是24小时内"}
{"time": 1774185041, "type": "recv", "message_id": "319223231", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=4AC546D78212BCD617D728E20EC95D95.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhSX3GoXcrQAFXQJPZPzMLwx7vEEfRj2fCD_CiiM5-eoyrOTAzIEcHJvZFCAvaMBWhAgzx-BBUAp6u5uM8y3ZBIzegLfY4IBAmd6&amp;rkey=CAISMNfv0cBkP6A-Y1Nd81kM36Npk4U1x1cjntjHBiT6B2KmIR-bJPyOXW_-x25fzSGRMQ,file_size=15990]"}
